- With no machine filter (All machines), every machine in the menu shows as checked instead of none.
- Cmd-click (Ctrl-click off macOS) on a machine while all are shown removes just that machine, so "all but one" is two clicks: All machines, then Cmd-click the one to hide.
- Stored keys still use an empty list for all machines; stale ids alone also count as all.

Port to 4c8a324e8f: the Machines bullet of docs/user/thread-sidebar.md (the Filter projects section, rewritten for upstream a03c43363b, #43206) now says All machines checks every machine and Cmd/Ctrl-click hides one. Code unchanged.

